OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start with sunny
OL,6,Fspells, with occasional heavy showers
OL,7,Fin the west. The showers develop more
OL,8,Fwidely for the afternoon as winds turn
OL,9,Fmore northwesterly and freshen, the
OL,10,Fshowers wintry over higher mountains.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers die out through the
OL,13,Fevening and winds ease. With long
OL,14,Fclear spells developing it will be a
OL,15,Fchilly night with a risk of frost in
OL,16,Fsheltered spots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
