OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA chilly start to a dry
OL,6,Fmorning with long sunny spells.
OL,7,FIncreasing cloud brings rain to
OL,8,Fwestern parts by mid-afternoon and all
OL,9,Fby evening, the rain becoming heavy in
OL,10,Fwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:
OL,13,FOccasionally heavy rain clearing
OL,14,Fovernight then sunny spells and
OL,15,Fblustery showers Friday, the showers
OL,16,Fbecoming heavier, more frequent
OL,17,FSaturday with northwesterly coastal
OL,18,Fgales. Mainly dry and bright Sunday,
OL,19,Fwinds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
